      "html": "<div id=\"shiny-modal\" class=\"modal fade\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h4 class=\"modal-title\">Import existing condition</h4>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <p>DEEP report CSV: deep-report.csv. The scores become each site's existing condition (No Action at the first target year); functions the source did not assess are marked not assessed.</p>\n        <div class=\"ce-table-wrap\">\n          <table class=\"ce-table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Reach</th>\n                <th class=\"num\">Length</th>\n                <th class=\"num\">Functions</th>\n                <th class=\"num\">ECI</th>\n                <th>Put into</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <strong>Demo Creek</strong>\n                  <div class=\"ce-muted\">12345</div>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"num\">1,000 ft</td>\n                <td class=\"num\">5 of 20</td>\n                <td class=\"num\">0.63</td>\n                <td>\n                  <div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\" style=\"width:220px;\">\n                    <label class=\"control-label shiny-label-null\" id=\"staf_target_0-label\" for=\"staf_target_0\"></label>\n                    <div>\n                      <select class=\"shiny-input-select form-select\" id=\"staf_target_0\">                        <option value=\"new\">New site</option>\n                        <option value=\"R1\">R1  Example Reach</option>\n                        <option value=\"R2\" selected=\"\">R2  Urban tributary</option>\n                        <option value=\"R3\">R3  Rural headwater</option>\n                        <option value=\"\">Skip</option></select>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"ce-note\">\n          <li>DEEP reports an ECI range for this assessment (0.09 to 0.84, condition not determinable, 15 of 20 functions not assessed): its bundle does not cover all 20 functions. CEICA scores the assessed functions only, so read the ECI as a relative measure for comparing alternatives, not as a condition claim.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-default\" type=\"button\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\">Cancel</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-default action-button btn-primary\" id=\"staf_import_ok\" type=\"button\">\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Import</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script>if (window.bootstrap && !window.bootstrap.Modal.VERSION.match(/^4\\. /)) {\n  var modal=new bootstrap.Modal(document.getElementById('shiny-modal'))\n  modal.show()\n} else {\n  $('#shiny-modal').modal().focus()\n}</script>\n</div>"
